ion's office market, driven by global capability centers.  Future expansion at Bhartiya Centre will add millions of square feet.  The Indian office market anticipates sustained occupier activity throughout the year.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/fm-leases-220000-sq-ft-office-space-at-bhartiya-centre-in-bengaluru/133169309?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-195854/133169309.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}]}